{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there was a black rabbit with a wild temper who lived an outcast life outside the Deep Wood forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, all of his special carrot crops disappeared! He embarks on a wild adventure to find the thief, using his powers of observation as well as his martial arts skills on anyone who gets in his way, even if it means taking on an entire forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/c2a3fac82bd6325acead99177f092c0f.poster.avif?t=1771576760\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/c2a3fac82bd6325acead99177f092c0f.webm?t=1771576760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/c2a3fac82bd6325acead99177f092c0f.mp4?t=1771576760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But things are more complicated than he thinks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wacky point-and-click adventure game set in a fairy tale forest with a dark secret.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/0bd5356b021f813f33b82e0063f075e1.poster.avif?t=1771576760\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/0bd5356b021f813f33b82e0063f075e1.webm?t=1771576760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/0bd5356b021f813f33b82e0063f075e1.mp4?t=1771576760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dual inventory: One for collecting items and one for collecting skills!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful 2D hand drawn backgrounds and animation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique story with lots of twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilarious characters, featuring lot of fairytales icons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Funny situations and dialogues. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying and balanced puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/367e79a4363ae124244104be10176f76.poster.avif?t=1771576760\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/367e79a4363ae124244104be10176f76.webm?t=1771576760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/367e79a4363ae124244104be10176f76.mp4?t=1771576760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No time to clean!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2654690/f7e0671699f006e15c139f6f4f327520b4078caf.jpg"},{"name":"Proud antisocial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2654690/962e44597b73f00223a44ca7c6c299aad43a2b8c.jpg"},{"name":"Just take the Shortcut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2654690/d085f38079f7ce37268a02a3125e14d723f71706.jpg"},{"name":"Trippin\u2019","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2654690/37d09713dd1a1eeb154645f88a2810e7107bd459.jpg"},{"name":"A bug's life","path":"https